ml_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T16:50:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T16:50:56Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\ncanonical name: [ISO Permission](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[i]/README.md#user-content-ISO-Permission:~:text=ISO%20Permission)\nshort name: ISO-Permission\ncategory: ISO Permission\nScanCode reference id: [iso-8879](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/iso-8879.LICENSE)\nOSI status: _none_\nOpen CoDE status: not approved\n\n**ScanCode**\nmatched id: [iso-8879](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/iso-8879.LICENSE)\n\n**Comment**\n+1 to add. We apply this as template, where the concrete ISO is variable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3281848459/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3386676030","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issue